his query returns rows, the test will fail, indicating a fan-out in the full outer join.\nselect \n    tool_name, \n    week_start, \n    count(*) as n\nfrom \"mds_health_db\".\"main\".\"fct_tool_weekly_snapshot\"\ngroup by 1, 2\nhaving count(*) > 1\n  \n  \n      \n    ) dbt_internal_test", "name": "SQLQuery", "pid": 25032, "thread": "Thread-1 (worker)", "ts": "2026-09-27T16:02:31.008570Z"}}
